  "seoTitle": "Listyo Sigit Named Suspect In Treason Case Against Prabowo",
  "metaDescription": "Former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five others face treason charges for allegedly tapping President Prabowo Subianto's communications.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Former Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five others were declared suspects in a treason investigation involving alleged illegal surveillance of President Prabowo Subianto.",
    "Police allege the group operated through three stages since 2024, which included mapping influential figures and conducting social media influence campaigns.",
    "Investigators recovered documents analyzing the 1998 resignation of President Soeharto and identified residential sites used as alleged operation bases."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) have officially named former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and five other individuals as suspects in a major treason investigation. Authorities claim the group orchestrated a three-stage plan originating in 2024, which allegedly aimed to undermine the administration of President Prabowo Subianto. Evidence presented by investigators includes reports on political crisis mapping and documents analyzing the 1998 downfall of former President Soeharto. Allegations involve the use of unauthorized surveillance against high-ranking figures, supported by operations conducted from several properties located in Jakarta and Bogor. Bareskrim Polri officials continue to process evidence as the suspects face potential capital punishment for these treason-related charges. The investigation remains a significant point of public interest following the discovery of materials linked to domestic political instability.",
